/* Register AQSemaphore **
** ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ */

/* A sempahore state arms the semaphore in the destination. SOURCE is the     **
** module which request the semaphore. Destination is the module which send   **
** the semaphore. The supported pair is BLT->FE, BLT->RA PE->FE, PE->RA,      **
** PA->FE. PA->FE: This should have been present starting in v6.0 for         **
** XS-configurations. This is in case TFB writes out a stream of vertices and **
** then FE needs to consume them.                                             */

